WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.650
On Saturday, your sailing group wants to head out. But will the weather hold?

2
00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:09.117
Step one: in the marketplace, pick the weather briefing template.

3
00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:14.617
Step two: enter the place, plus one sentence in your own words.

4
00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:21.217
Step three: you get a finished briefing with real weather data. Five dry days, good for sailing.

5
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:26.850
No coding, no prompts. And your browser checks first that the template is unchanged.

6
00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:33.583
Weather, contracts or charts: always the same three steps. Pick a template below and click Try it.
